23	// DEVDESK-754 (SC1, step 3): `g` switches the CVE tab between the findings table
24	// and the grouped list, one row per cause. The findings table is never rebuilt by
25	// the switch: its filter, its sort, its query and its cursor are what the user
26	// left (AC4). Footer timers are never run: the footer is read through Text and
27	// Level. User decisions pinned here: `g` is the third key of the results column;
28	// the mode is held per tab for the life of the view; only the CVE tab groups.
